WEBVTT

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:32.851
Soko la ubunifu la Kenya ni lile lenye msukumo,

00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:34.726
kimataifa, linalotazama mbele,


00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.018
na bila shaka,

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:39.167
soko la uzalishaji la kesho lililo la ukweli.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.559
Lakini ni kweli nguvu ipo katika uwezo wa kusaidia kuponya akili ya Kenya,

00:04:45.583 --> 00:04:48.875
ili hatimaye tuweze kujenga taifa kwa uhalisia.

00:04:49.958 --> 00:04:51.226
Asante.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:56.726
(Makofi)

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.268
(Makofi)

00:04:59.292 --> 00:05:01.851
Kwa wimbo huu, naomba wote tuchukue dakika moja